      </h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vh-why" id="why-vectra">
    <div class="vh-wrap vh-why__grid">
      <div class="vh-why__media">
        <img src="{{ img_why }}" alt="Partnership in the field" width="980" height="720">
        <div class="vh-why__nav">← WHY VECTRA →</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vh-why__copy">
        <p class="vh-kicker">Why VECTRA</p>
        <h2>Partnership with accountability. Built for implementation.</h2>
        <p>
          We combine human expertise, an ecosystem of specialists, AI-enabled intelligence, and structured execution—then stay accountable for the outcomes that matter.
        </p>
        <div class="vh-why__list">
          <div class="vh-why__item">
            <img src="{{ img_icon_1 }}" alt="">
            <div>
              <h3>Progress you can measure</h3>
              <p>Practical implementation makes improvement visible and durable.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="vh-why__item">
            <img src="{{ img_icon_2 }}" alt="">
            <div>
              <h3>Integrated expertise around the work</h3>
              <p>Curated specialists, tools, and learning shaped to your context.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="vh-why__item">
            <img src="{{ img_icon_3 }}" alt="">
            <div>
              <h3>AI-enabled. Human-led.</h3>
              <p>Technology makes expert judgment more timely and useful.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="vh-why__item">
            <img src="{{ img_icon_4 }}" alt="">
            <div>
              <h3>Your success is our success</h3>
              <p>We work toward business outcomes, not a list of deliverables.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="vh-btn vh-btn--green" href="#solutions">
          Explore our approach
          <img src="{{ img_arrow }}" alt="">
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vh-esg">
